// B1 course (A2 → B1 roadmap), module 13 „Suhtlemine ja probleemilahendus” (a2b1-061…065), stage A2+/B1-.
// All three phases (these lessons had no sheets): Avasta → Harjuta → Kasuta, each a whole lesson (40–55 min).
// Functional independence over perfect grammar: asking, offering and refusing, the conditional for politeness
// (sooviksin, saaksin, võiksin), conflict and compromise, reacting to the unexpected (asking again, rephrasing,
// offering an alternative). The learner must carry a dialogue on after an unexpected line.
